<title>MEXICO: SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT HONDURAS 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT HONDURAS 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico beat Honduras 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a CONCACAF semi-final stage group three</p>
<p>World Cup qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mexico - Benjamin Galindo (32nd), Carlos Hermosillo</p>
<p>(34th), Zague (42nd)</p>
<p>Honduras - Enrique Renau Zenteno (69th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 114,000</p>
</text>
